  note    = {StarPO; trajectory-level agent RL; the Echo Trap instability},
  further = {no},
  tldr    = {RAGEN introduces StarPO, a multi-turn trajectory-level RL framework for LLM agents, and identifies training instability patterns (Echo Trap) plus rollout design principles that enable stable agent self-evolution.},
